================================================================================
NOTE ON SOURCE DATA
================================================================================
The event logs distributed under data/event_logs/ are derived from anonymized
records made available by the Brazilian National Council of Justice (CNJ)
through its Codex data lake. The Codex itself is restricted to public-process
data already subjected to the CNJ's anonymization rules. The further
anonymization applied in this repository is documented in
data/anonymization/anonym.py and data/README.md.
